   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Home[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]Alle programma’s[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]Ayurvedische behandelingen[[CLOSE_5]][[OPEN_6]]/[[CLOSE_6]][[OPEN_7]]Ayurvedische Panchakarma-ontgiftingstherapie[[CLOSE_7]]",
