   "sourceHash": "4498ca83c5f3e2dd23b40417b13190b120403a54c296aa5d598aafc2dfa62c73",
   "text": "Wetenschappelijke ontgifting voor lichaam, geest en doshabalans, door 80% van de patiënten vertrouwd | 30,000+ levens veranderd",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-register substitution: 'guest' → 'patiënten'. Statistical claims (80%, 30,000+) carried over from source unverified; numbers kept in source format per rules — needs clinical/fact sign-off."
